color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"轮值后给予补偿休息（被呼醒后次日晚到）\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"定期 Review 告警质量，消除虚假告警\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"On-Call 周减少 feature 开发任务量\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"提供心理安全：出错不追责，追责只追流程\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"自动化常见处理流程（runbook automation）\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"团队 >= 4 人才能建立健康的轮值\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"工具链集成\">工具链集成</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;监控系统&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;告警&quot;| B[&quot;PagerDuty/OpsGenie&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;通知&quot;| C[&quot;On-Call 工程师&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;自动创建&quot;| D[&quot;Incident Ticket&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;ACK/升级&quot;| B&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;协作&quot;| E[&quot;Slack War Room&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt;|&quot;自动记录&quot;| F[&quot;Timeline Bot&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt;|&quot;输出&quot;| G[&quot;Postmortem 模板&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"监控系统\"] --&gt;|\"告警\"| B[\"PagerDuty/OpsGenie\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"通知\"| C[\"On-Call 工程师\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"自动创建\"| D[\"Incident Ticket\"]\n    C --&gt;|\"ACK/升级\"| B\n    C --&gt;|\"协作\"| E[\"Slack War Room\"]\n    E --&gt;|\"自动记录\"| F[\"Timeline Bot\"]\n    F --&gt;|\"输出\"| G[\"Postmortem 模板\"]</pre><h2 id=\"工具与生态\">工具与生态</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>核心能力</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>告警路由</td>\n<td>PagerDuty, OpsGenie, Grafana OnCall</td>\n<td>轮值排班、升级策略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事件管理</td>\n<td>incident.io, Rootly, FireHydrant</td>\n<td>自动化事件流程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态页</td>\n<td>Statuspage, Cachet, Instatus</td>\n<td>对外沟通</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>沟通协作</td>\n<td>Slack (War Room), Teams</td>\n<td>实时协作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自动化</td>\n<td>Rundeck, StackStorm</td>\n<td>Runbook 自动执行</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>线上问题分级是生产稳定性的制度保障。关键实践：建立清晰的 P0-P4 分级标准、配置合理的升级策略、指定 IC 负责协调、标准化沟通模板。好的分级体系让团队在压力下仍能理性决策，避免&quot;所有问题都是紧急&quot;的混乱状态。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"线上问题分级与响应","id":"线上问题分级与响应"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"故障分级体系","id":"故障分级体系"},{"level":3,"text":"On-Call 轮值制度","id":"on-call-轮值制度"},{"level":3,"text":"故障指挥官（Incident Commander）","id":"故障指挥官-incident-commander"},{"level":2,"text":"实战指南","id":"实战指南"},{"level":3,"text":"故障响应时间线","id":"故障响应时间线"},{"level":3,"text":"分级判断决策树","id":"分级判断决策树"},{"level":3,"text":"升级策略","id":"升级策略"},{"level":3,"text":"沟通模板","id":"沟通模板"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":3,"text":"On-Call 健康度指标","id":"on-call-健康度指标"},{"level":3,"text":"避免 On-Call 倦怠","id":"避免-on-call-倦怠"},{"level":3,"text":"工具链集成","id":"工具链集成"},{"level":2,"text":"工具与生态","id":"工具与生态"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"}],"prev":{"title":"瓶颈定位方法论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/debugging-troubleshooting/performance-profiling/bottleneck-identification"},"next":{"title":"故障排查 SOP","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/debugging-troubleshooting/production-debugging/troubleshooting-sop"}}